WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.777
A1.1 · What a language model does

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.729
A language model is trained to predict what comes next in text.

3
00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:14.113
From that one task it learns to write, summarise, reason and code.

4
00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:19.476
Without tools it has no access to your ledger or today's rates.

5
00:00:19.526 --> 00:00:25.026
Plausible and right usually coincide. When they do not, the answer still reads well.

6
00:00:26.176 --> 00:00:30.890
The assistant is the product around the model: chat, files, connectors.

7
00:00:33.476 --> 00:00:37.200
Next: A1.2  Strong and weak points for finance

